SUMMARY:(1512) Oulu hides a mag 10.8 star (just outside the path)
DESCRIPTION:(1512) Oulu hides a magnitude 10.8 star\, seen from Cuddalore.\
 nThe predicted edge passes 16 km to the SSE\, so a miss is likely — but 
 a chord from near the edge is the most valuable observation of all.\nClose
 st approach 04:59:22 IST\, give or take 2 s. The star is 38° up in the WS
 W · dark sky.\nIt fades 4.5 magnitudes for up to 6.6 s on the centre line
 \, and the path is 80 km wide\, give or take 21 km.\nFinder chart\, the ma
 p and the path as KML: https://occult.alokm.com/asteroids-2027-08#2027-08-
 06-1512-oulu-444224
